 "certainty": "C overall. B for the export mix 2021-2024 (Comtrade) and for the sector profitability anchors (Ukrstat). C for grain, oilseeds, iron ore and steel shares: built from Ukrstat sector profitability, crop profitability from trade analysts, USDA farm/FOB spreads and company reports, but capital intensity, farm/FOB ratios and tax incidence are estimated. D-to-C for food_other, metals_other, wood, machinery, chemicals and other: judgement values anchored on Ukrstat industry profitability (0.8-11%) and tolling/low-margin structure, no product-level margin data. 2025 and 2026 have no Ukrstat profitability data yet; they rest on company and analyst data. Mix 2025 is B-/C, 2026 Jan-Aug C.",
